# Implementation Experience # {#implementation}

P1219R2 links to an experimental <a href="https://github.com/Bekenn/clang/tree/func-parm-packs">Clang branch</a>. [[P1219R2]] Its tests use an earlier <code>template &lt;&gt;</code> primary-template spelling. [[P1219-CLANG-TESTS]]

